# Text files check out with LF on every OS. Git for Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true, which turned them into CRLF and broke every generated
# file check (and shell script) on a Windows copy of GSAM.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Committed with CRLF; left as it is.
adapter-plugin.md -text
patches/*.patch whitespace=-space-before-tab
